  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Crisis Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supercedes SOMA88.  The funds Oxfam GB will provide to Somaliland/ Somalia will be to provide life saving assistance to those affected by drought and cholera. These funds will be used for assistance in Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) and Emergency Food Security and Vulnerable Livelihoods (EFSVL) but also support the team in terms of other costs (staffing, logistics etc)</narrative>
  </description>
